        "original_id": "1bc7c116-3436-51c6-b6b6-8b15afff206f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: The System (1964 film), The Girl-Getters\n- People: Michael Winner, Oliver Reed, Jane Merrow, Barbara Ferris\n- Topics: British drama films, English actors\n\nFacts:\n- The System, released in 1964, is a British drama film.\n- The System was released in the United States under the title The Girl-Getters.\n- The System was directed by Michael Winner.\n- The System stars Oliver Reed, Jane Merrow, and Barbara Ferris.\n- Robert Oliver Reed was born on 13 February 1938 and died on 2 May 1999.\n- Oliver Reed was an English actor.\n- Oliver Reed was known for an upper-middle-class, macho image, a hellraiser lifestyle, and tough-guy roles.",
